"You're receiving this email because you requested a password reset for your "
"user account at %(site_name)s."
msgstr ""
"Tu reçois cet e-mail car tu as demandé la réinitialisation du mot de passe "
"de ton compte sur %(site_name)s."

#: users/templates/users/password_reset/email.html:4
